Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream,\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through, believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers. Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with the super powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain is all motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we got all strong again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Conkron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Donut!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Power, Mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, decided on a new look?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.26,0:03:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One might say too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All clear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom won't allow her\Nreputation to be tarnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is only a temporary reprieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be so, but we've made\Nour choice and we must carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, our priority\Nis getting back on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:03:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to pacify Big Mom's\Nwrath and reunite with our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suspect that this\Nwill go off without a hitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have to have faith in our friends\Nand make sure that we don't let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a message to\Nevery island in Totoland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We must prepare for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dispatch all Dodge ships immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The honor of the Big\NMom Pirates is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.30,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three pirate crews\Nwho must face our wrath. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who in a short time have caused immeasurable\Ndamage to our home and our pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Second are the traitors,\Nthe Fire Tank Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They repaid Mama's generosity with deceit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,plotting to assassinate her and\Ndestroying Pudding's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally the Sun Pirates, the\Ntwo-faced associates of Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He declared an open revolt against\NMama, and his crew turned tail and ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But all three of those detestable crews\Nare still within the seas of Totoland,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,fleeing to save their lonely lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're supposed to search for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Territory Slugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the story, but it\Nsounds like they all disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single enemy\Nleave our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Put them down like the\Nfilthy animals they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal the bastards limb from limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fury their ships at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's clear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep my cool, you\Nhave no hope of defeating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make you drop your guard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you're shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, guess I'm done\Nusing fourth gear for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for giving me a heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I gotta get far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold out for ten minutes,\Nthen I can use Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So his power-up has a time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so generous as to let you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need those ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get wrecked\Nif I don't have my Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! He's catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really, really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Overall weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened when he\Ntried the whipped cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it was poisoned? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask him if he liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I could die happy because it's so tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The cream almost took him to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's dangerously delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That whipped cream is\Nthe secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was talking about the\Nessence of true sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it—the ultimate cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Simpson whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, pudding, but there's\Nno way I can allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never do this without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,help
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole point is to not pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To think if such exquisite\Ncream was spread on a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your imagination's going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And here you have my\Nfamous fluffy chiffon cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, hold it down. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so fluffy that it's gonna float away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just finished up my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As well, it's perfectly\Nsmooth and perfectly sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The freshest and finest chocolate with\Na hint of Sanji's whipped cream too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta put a lid on it\Nbecause this chocolate's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so smooth it's slipping\Nright out of the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Five
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,minutes till
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,six—everything's right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the ship ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To save some time, we'll put the finishing\Ntouches on the cake after we set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny is on its way here, and\NI want to meet up with it asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,sir You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish up this cake\Nand go take down an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in disguise, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the way for us, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to take the cake to the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They threw it together so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really gonna pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will surety love\Nthis cake when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even need to taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less from\NLady Pudding and Lady Chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget WCI-31.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,can't leave mama waiting\Ncan we wouldn't dream of it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you just wait big mom this\Ncake is gonna blow your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Power march in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Pulmei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help before he captures me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we? A house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay, Branch. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you, Branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can relax in here\Nwhile I get my Haki back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to the wrong\Nplace. She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no wedding king here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lots of nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's big mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be Chiffon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, grown-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Oven. Can this wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you intend to\Ntake that wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that you want\Nto stop Mama's hunger bangs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but the plan was to ambush\Nher and the Straw Hats here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We decided to finish the cake on\Na ship and intercept Mama at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell at sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it ensures that Mama won't\Ncause any damage to Chocolat Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is give Press a call,\Nthen we can all meet up and stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Agree, that is a splendid plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me then please\Ncarry on and good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise we won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying here with me. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, how could he do that to his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a thing, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is none of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a family issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let them carry the cake to the porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiffon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After what happened, you should know better\Nthan to show your face in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You share a part in your\Nhusband's unforgivable crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I would simply forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you were family,\Ntreason's a heavy sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She came here to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get in his way, he'll\Nbrand you a traitor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worried about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I blow my cover to save\Nher, we could all be screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.29,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come back to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My debt to Nami won't be repaid\Nuntil they leave here safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die till that cake is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved loneless life. I can't\Ndie. I have to fight to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not some teenager going\Nthrough a rebellious phase wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a traitor who tried to\Nassassinate the leader of our country
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it brings me no joy to kill\Nmy little sister like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then please stop it We need to set an\Nexample for other would-be traitors We have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to help her I don't have time to worry\Nabout the consequences But I need an opening
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off her, right\Nnow! Armin, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll save you, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Huh? Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd toss your\Ndumb ass into the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I just have to get her to safety\Nbefore anyone notices I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to fly, Shafana. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to fly, Shafana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knocked over Minister Oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Oven and where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That obviously wasn't you, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not at war!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Question is, who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I kept you waiting for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Chiffon, head under this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,More, more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the way, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg rescued me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world was that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's odd!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Oven! Stop it! Rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We need her, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't have Shipvon's help,\Nwe can't finish Mama's wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't finish Mama's wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,cake just accept your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I will burn you until nothing remains!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven, we found Petchy's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heading your way now,\Nstraight to Kaku Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fleet is pursuing them as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll drive them into the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Petchy, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought your husband\Nwas going to leave you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's not as heartless as he seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Petchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Benji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Auburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Auburn's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just caught your accomplice,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,or rather your dear wife, as she was\Nabout to leave Kaku Island. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they captured the madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Conveniently, we just left town\Nand are heading to the port now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you just keep sailing straight like you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,are already and you can\Nsurrender when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've been stopped\Nthem before they can take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They expected trouble,\Nbut this is a damn mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She may be my sister, but I\Nwill kill her on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So I make extra sure you\Ndon't step out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Benji, just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who decided to\Ncome here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If they capture you, they're\Nstill going to execute all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I die, I want you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama has hated me for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are my real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed me the meaning of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So live on, and someday,\Ntake revenge for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As if we could just\Nleave you and go, Lili!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shafan, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll enter the port like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up, no funny business!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:23:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my boy, but you keep\Nyour dirty little mitts off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As your fun capisce
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,very well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who knew you were such a softy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna cost you your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should have run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.36,0:23:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Banshee's ship is pulling in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All soldiers, prepare to fire on command!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tarts, separate into right and left\Nflanks and block their escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's surrendering\Nwithout a fight after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Evans' carriage\Nis arriving at the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? And Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.36,0:23:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Amand, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.65,0:24:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that guy over there Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Straw Hat showed up after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.16,0:24:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And he must have my case!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He thought Big Mom was chasing the Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.50,0:24:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives, Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did this situation make any sense to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rescue me, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.80,0:24:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.28,0:24:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, star hat, where\Nare you hiding my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Press, anyone help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Release my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dandy Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, it's time for third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.14,0:25:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kum Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.44,0:25:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.98,0:25:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No use, I can't break it without my Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.26,0:25:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.00,0:25:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's surrounding us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow walks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.26,0:25:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.90,0:25:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're trying to help,\Nbut please don't cut me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.62,0:25:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My famed Blade Shit longs to deliver\Na painful, lingering death to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.90,0:25:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to run, but I can't\Nfight you guys right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.70,0:25:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find a mirror! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.22,0:26:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a problem, Pedos.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wall is in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy Slug!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.06,0:26:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.86,0:26:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to keep running\Ntill I get my Haki back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.28,0:26:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.98,0:26:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Heros, please stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.80,0:26:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.38,0:27:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you want to kill Straw\NHat, but focus your destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.68,0:27:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.90,0:27:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.48,0:27:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole town is reduced to rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.02,0:27:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.02,0:27:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, was that close or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's good that Big Mom is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good for me so much, but it means\Nthe others must have gotten away safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.88,0:27:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.79,0:28:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Mom Pirates are catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.46,0:28:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. You ready? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.36,0:28:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All this running around was getting dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.58,0:28:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we fight. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.92,0:28:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.80,0:28:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.34,0:28:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.64,0:28:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a big battle coming, so get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.16,0:28:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.32,0:28:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.76,0:28:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is tonight gonna be a full moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ruppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ruppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.80,0:29:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was smooth as hell, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this, Pez. Watch close.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.84,0:29:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how I roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your papa's way of life. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.90,0:30:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do next, we've got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.66,0:30:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.04,0:30:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up, Branch? It's Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.86,0:30:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Chip's Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.26,0:30:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy has been\Nsighted in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.98,0:30:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.38,0:30:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Chock Full Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat has been sighted. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.58,0:30:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just in Chip's Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's popping up all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.78,0:30:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be running through the Miro World.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.68,0:30:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.72,0:30:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really get caught again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Greentown!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.38,0:30:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have multiple calls from citizens\Nreporting that they saw someone suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.26,0:30:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.74,0:31:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to escape, then\Njust go to Cacao Island. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.76,0:31:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know about our plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was eavesdropping on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.56,0:31:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.62,0:31:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.86,0:31:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.34,0:31:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll\Never defeat my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.60,0:31:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki doesn't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If the fight goes on long enough, his\Nobservation powers will get weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.08,0:31:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.14,0:31:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee, wee, wee, wee.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a dope, but you're\Npretty sharp when it comes to fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.86,0:31:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.60,0:31:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.51,0:31:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you the best lessons I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.98,0:32:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but Haki becomes much stronger\Nin the heat of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be the true test.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.90,0:32:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And the stronger the enemies you face,\Nthe faster your own strength will evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.60,0:32:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.74,0:32:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.16,0:32:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck, you little shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to surpass him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to fight him at his full strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I'll defeat him,\Nthe Billionberry Man.
